# Opt-in filter for Anthy's one-off initialization and prediction allocations.
# anthy_conf_override/anthy_init and prediction retain storage after anthy_quit.
# A direct probe retained 116 bytes after both 10 and 2,000 prediction calls.
# Anthy stays loaded even after failed starts; libanthy matches both libanthy.so
# and libanthydic.so in exit-time stacks, including their versioned names.
# This also hides application-caused leaks allocated inside either library; keep
# raw logs and investigate ownership or growth without this filter.
leak:libanthy
